/reference/gunyah-refs/*/.git/
/reference/gunyah-refs/**/*.b64

# 96 MiB 签名槽位镜像不入库（可重建）
# ---- reports/artifacts/ 统一口径（2026-11-26 整理轮 T10 收敛；原 173 条逐目录规则合并为此块）----
# 判据：artifacts 只入库「可读证据」（md/txt/清单/patch/diff/小图）。
# 日志（.log/.out/.err）与二进制一律不入库 —— 个别需要入库的日志用 `git add -f` 显式放行。
# 已入库的历史件保持 tracked（gitignore 不追溯）；新增件按本块判定；旧逐目录规则见 git 历史。
reports/artifacts/**
!reports/artifacts/
!reports/artifacts/**/
!reports/artifacts/**/*.md
!reports/artifacts/**/*.txt
!reports/artifacts/**/*.tsv
!reports/artifacts/**/*.json
!reports/artifacts/**/*.sha256
!reports/artifacts/**/*.sums
!reports/artifacts/**/*.diff
!reports/artifacts/**/*.patch
!reports/artifacts/**/*.dts
!reports/artifacts/**/*.dtsi
!reports/artifacts/**/*.c
!reports/artifacts/**/*.h
!reports/artifacts/**/*.sh
!reports/artifacts/**/*.cfg
!reports/artifacts/**/*.conf
!reports/artifacts/**/*.ini
!reports/artifacts/**/*.csv
!reports/artifacts/**/*.yaml
!reports/artifacts/**/*.yml
!reports/artifacts/**/*.png
!reports/artifacts/**/*.jpg
!reports/artifacts/**/*.jpeg
!reports/artifacts/**/*.svg
# 抓取缓存（patchwork/lore 原始 JSON，可重抓）不入库 —— 放在白名单之后，最后匹配优先
reports/artifacts/**/cache/
